@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Programs";
}

<h2 class="text-orange">🌍 Our Programs</h2>
<p class="lead">
    At <strong>Gift of the Givers</strong>, we respond to urgent crises and invest in long-term, sustainable community upliftment.
    Guided by compassion and humanity, we ensure aid reaches those who need it most.
</p>

<hr />

<div class="program-card mb-4">
    <h4 class="text-deepgreen">⚡ Fast and Active Disaster Response</h4>
    <p>
        When disaster strikes, we mobilize immediately. Our teams deliver <strong>
            shelter, food, blankets, medical supplies,
            generators, and rescue services
        </strong>. We also rebuild damaged homes, schools, and healthcare facilities to restore dignity and stability.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="program-card mb-4">
    <h4 class="text-deepgreen">🍞 Hunger Alleviation</h4>
    <p>
        Hunger is a universal problem. We distribute <strong>100,000+ food parcels annually</strong>, support feeding schemes,
        and prepare thousands of hot meals daily. Our agricultural projects and livestock feed initiatives sustain struggling farmers during droughts.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="program-card mb-4">
    <h4 class="text-deepgreen">💧 Water Provision</h4>
    <p>
        Water is life. We deploy <strong>tankers, boreholes, desalination plants, purification systems, and recycling projects</strong>
        to deliver clean water to desperate communities. Our geohydrologist-led team ensures sustainable access to safe water in schools, clinics, and villages.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="program-card mb-4">
    <h4 class="text-deepgreen">🏥 Healthcare</h4>
    <p>
        Access to healthcare is a right. We operate hospitals in conflict zones, support clinics,
        and fund treatments for patients who cannot afford care. Our work includes <strong>
            primary healthcare, maternal services,
            audiology screening, and wheelchair distribution
        </strong>, ensuring no one is left behind.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="program-card mb-4">
    <h4 class="text-deepgreen">📚 Education</h4>
    <p>
        Education changes lives. Our initiatives include <strong>
            bursaries, school infrastructure development,
            learning materials, and potable water for schools
        </strong>. We empower learners to unlock their potential
        and pursue brighter futures.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="program-card mb-4">
    <h4 class="text-deepgreen">🤝 Human Development</h4>
    <p>
        We believe in dignity through empowerment. Our programs offer <strong>
            counselling, life skills training,
            and skills development workshops
        </strong> to uplift communities and support mental and emotional wellbeing.
    </p>
</div>

<hr />

